{"c":[{"name":"20261005T220819Z-878907191e2eb647","text":"P2: engines/page-link.ts no longer walks after a verified pageWrite/pageSelect/pageSetChecked; it patches that control in the tab's last walk and walks once TRAILING_WALK_MS after the last act. Tests that expected a pageWalk after an ok write must expect the patch.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261005T220819Z-d4c70d849120ef71","text":"P2: an Ask about a page (goals:true) comes back as AskGoal.page and is planned by goals/page-planner.ts with no writer; its steps are gate 'fill', which only lowering marks (gates.ts markFilled, by identity), so GoalRuns.propose refuses a structuredClone'd page plan.","type":"note"}]}
